				155,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Sky): Implement webview reveal, setTitle, and setIconPath bridges\n\nExtend the `InstallWebview` bridge layer in Sky to handle runtime panel updates and focus management. Register listeners for `sky://webview/setTitle`, `sky://webview/setIconPath`, and `sky://webview/reveal` to intercept extension calls.\n\nThe `setTitle` and `setIconPath` handlers dispatch DOM events for UI synchronization and invoke native methods on parked webview entries. The `reveal` handler implements logic to open views via the `Views` service for view IDs or focus specific webview panels by handle, respecting the `preserveFocus` flag.\n\nAdditionally, restore the `sky://webview/dispose` registration which was previously relocated, ensuring panels are correctly cleaned up to prevent stale DOM node accumulation. These additions complete the lifecycle control surface for the webview component layer.",
			"SHA": "aaa182cebde41b5e0030065feb8eeab066223325"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-23T09:35:53Z",
			"File": [
				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				155,
				2
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Sky): Standardize IPC method naming and add webview option bridge\n\nUpdate IPC method identifiers in `InstallEditorAndOutput.ts` to use the new lowercase `file:` namespace (`file:writeFile`, `file:rename`, `file:delete`) instead of the previous `FileSystem.` prefix. This aligns the bridge layer with the updated Mountain backend protocol conventions.\n\nIn `InstallWebview.ts`, implement the `sky://webview/setOptions` bridge listener to handle runtime configuration updates (e.g., `enableScripts`, `localResourceRoots`). The handler resolves the target webview panel from the global registry and invokes the native `setOptions` method, supporting both Cocoon-originated requests and direct notifications.\n\nThese changes streamline the IPC contract and ensure webview lifecycle operations are handled synchronously and deterministically within the Sky component layer.",
			"SHA": "faa9c2543f6c806b9af5ef86198469a660b4e7d1"
		}
